      "cooked": "<p>The link provided in VM Login instruction is wrong. Refer to screenshot given below.<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://europe1.discourse-cdn.com/flex013/uploads/iitm/original/3X/4/1/41615d1ab406a761c6c72560477c1d5cef387d14.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/9knDs0UWByUaGk3KEJZ8R4Wjd8E.jpeg?dl=1\" title=\"wrong_link\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><img src=\"https://europe1.discourse-cdn.com/flex013/uploads/iitm/optimized/3X/4/1/41615d1ab406a761c6c72560477c1d5cef387d14_2_517x257.jpeg\" alt=\"wrong_link\" data-base62-sha1=\"9knDs0UWByUaGk3KEJZ8R4Wjd8E\" width=\"517\" height=\"257\" srcset=\"https://europe1.discourse-cdn.com/flex013/uploads/iitm/optimized/3X/4/1/41615d1ab406a761c6c72560477c1d5cef387d14_2_517x257.jpeg, https://europe1.discourse-cdn.com/flex013/uploads/iitm/optimized/3X/4/1/41615d1ab406a761c6c72560477c1d5cef387d14_2_775x385.jpeg 1.5x, https://europe1.discourse-cdn.com/flex013/uploads/iitm/optimized/3X/4/1/41615d1ab406a761c6c72560477c1d5cef387d14_2_1034x514.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"EBEAEB\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">wrong_link</span><span class=\"informations\">1366×680 153 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>The correct link for accessing the VM Login is <a href=\"https://se2001.ds.study.iitm.ac.in/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://se2001.ds.study.iitm.ac.in/</a><br>\nYou can login from here.</p>\n<p><a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/puneet_21f3002005\">@Puneet_21f3002005</a> sir, if possible look into this matter.</p>\n<p>With Regards,<br>\nIshant</p>",
